# Myr Battlesphere attacks Bot1's own Invasion of Gobakhan, which Bot2 protects. A battle is neither "the player" nor
# "the planeswalker it's attacking", so tapping two Myr gives it +2/+0 and deals no damage: the battle keeps all three
# defense counters until combat damage, and Bot2 takes nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Plains
Myr Battlesphere
Plains
Invasion of Gobakhan
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

